I have had similar-type problems in compiling Qt Nethack under Linux.
Two things I have to do that are not in any README:
(1) Instead of running "make", I run "QTDIR=/usr/lib/qt3 make". Adjust
the directory appropriately for your situation.
(2) In src/Makefile, I have to change
WINQTLIB = -L$(QTDIR)/lib -lqt
to
WINQTLIB = -L$(QTDIR)/lib -lqt-mt

Hope that helps.

